{"page":316,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"310","words":[{"text":"310","x":216,"y":134,"width":76,"height":38}]},{"text":"CHAPTER04 • 네트위크 계층 : 데이터 평면","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER04","x":599,"y":136,"width":166,"height":27},{"text":"•","x":797,"y":145,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"네트위크","x":842,"y":139,"width":101,"height":29},{"text":"계층","x":954,"y":138,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":":","x":1017,"y":142,"width":7,"height":20},{"text":"데이터","x":1037,"y":138,"width":74,"height":28},{"text":"평면","x":1124,"y":139,"width":48,"height":28}]},{"text":"223.1.1.1","words":[{"text":"223.1.1.1","x":1000,"y":261,"width":120,"height":25}]},{"text":"223.1.9.2","words":[{"text":"223.1.9.2","x":974,"y":613,"width":122,"height":26}]},{"text":"223.1.9.1","words":[{"text":"223.1.9.1","x":807,"y":777,"width":122,"height":26}]},{"text":"223.1.2.6","words":[{"text":"223.1.2.6","x":755,"y":911,"width":126,"height":28}]},{"text":"223.1.2.1","words":[{"text":"223.1.2.1","x":772,"y":1231,"width":121,"height":26}]},{"text":"223.1.8.1","words":[{"text":"223.1.8.1","x":1033,"y":893,"width":120,"height":25}]},{"text":"223.1.2.2","words":[{"text":"223.1.2.2","x":1021,"y":1231,"width":123,"height":25}]},{"text":"223.1.1.4","words":[{"text":"223.1.1.4","x":1252,"y":264,"width":127,"height":26}]},{"text":"223.1.1.3","words":[{"text":"223.1.1.3","x":1234,"y":529,"width":128,"height":26}]},{"text":"-223.1.7.0","words":[{"text":"-223.1.7.0","x":1224,"y":616,"width":180,"height":25}]},{"text":"223.1.8.0","words":[{"text":"223.1.8.0","x":1210,"y":893,"width":128,"height":25}]},{"text":"223.1.3.1","words":[{"text":"223.1.3.1","x":1254,"y":1231,"width":126,"height":25}]},{"text":"223.1.7.1","words":[{"text":"223.1.7.1","x":1445,"y":781,"width":130,"height":24}]},{"text":"223.1.3.27","words":[{"text":"223.1.3.27","x":1499,"y":917,"width":152,"height":25}]},{"text":"223.1.3.2","words":[{"text":"223.1.3.2","x":1518,"y":1232,"width":136,"height":24}]},{"text":"그림 4.20 • 6개의 서브넷을 연결하는 3개의 라우터","words":[{"text":"그림","x":554,"y":1290,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"4.20","x":623,"y":1291,"width":70,"height":30},{"text":"•","x":707,"y":1299,"width":16,"height":14},{"text":"6개의","x":737,"y":1290,"width":72,"height":32},{"text":"서브넷을","x":819,"y":1290,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"연결하는","x":937,"y":1290,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"3개의","x":1055,"y":1290,"width":70,"height":32},{"text":"라우터","x":1137,"y":1289,"width":79,"height":32}]},{"text":"인터넷 주소 할당 방식에 CIDR (Classless lnterdomain Routing—사이다(cider)","words":[{"text":"인터넷","x":623,"y":1437,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"주소","x":733,"y":1440,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"할당","x":810,"y":1437,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"방식에","x":887,"y":1436,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"CIDR","x":997,"y":1441,"width":94,"height":29},{"text":"(Classless","x":1102,"y":1441,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"lnterdomain","x":1265,"y":1440,"width":212,"height":30},{"text":"Routing—사이다(cider)","x":1488,"y":1440,"width":369,"height":39}]},{"text":"로 발음된다)[RFC 463기라는 것이 있다. CIDR은 서브넷 주소체계 표기를 일반화하","words":[{"text":"로","x":553,"y":1500,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"발음된다)[RFC","x":603,"y":1498,"width":231,"height":40},{"text":"463기라는","x":848,"y":1498,"width":155,"height":40},{"text":"것이","x":1019,"y":1499,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1099,"y":1498,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"CIDR은","x":1187,"y":1498,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"서브넷","x":1329,"y":1498,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"주소체계","x":1448,"y":1499,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"표기를","x":1609,"y":1500,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"일반화하","x":1735,"y":1500,"width":124,"height":39}]},{"text":"고 있다. 서브넷 주소체계로서, 32비트 IP 주소는 두 부분으로 나누고, 이것은 다시 점","words":[{"text":"고","x":552,"y":1562,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"있다.","x":601,"y":1558,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"서브넷","x":691,"y":1560,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"주소체계로서,","x":803,"y":1559,"width":205,"height":40},{"text":"32비트","x":1023,"y":1561,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"IP","x":1139,"y":1565,"width":33,"height":29},{"text":"주소는","x":1185,"y":1562,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1298,"y":1562,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"부분으로","x":1346,"y":1560,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"나누고,","x":1501,"y":1561,"width":116,"height":40},{"text":"이것은","x":1635,"y":1562,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"다시","x":1754,"y":1561,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"점","x":1832,"y":1563,"width":24,"height":37}]},{"text":"으로 된 십진수 형태의 a.b.c.d/x를 가지며, 여기서 Ⅹ는 주소 첫 부분의 비트 수이다.","words":[{"text":"으로","x":551,"y":1621,"width":69,"height":31},{"text":"된","x":633,"y":1621,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"십진수","x":679,"y":1622,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"형태의","x":792,"y":1622,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"a.b.c.d/x를","x":900,"y":1624,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"가지며,","x":1075,"y":1622,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"여기서","x":1195,"y":1622,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"Ⅹ는","x":1304,"y":1624,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"주소","x":1371,"y":1624,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"첫","x":1455,"y":1623,"width":32,"height":39},{"text":"부분의","x":1501,"y":1624,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"비트","x":1624,"y":1625,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"수이다.","x":1707,"y":1625,"width":109,"height":39}]},{"text":"a.b.c.d/x 형식 주소에서 최상위 비트(most significant bit, MSB)를 의미하는","words":[{"text":"a.b.c.d/x","x":618,"y":1688,"width":132,"height":31},{"text":"형식","x":765,"y":1685,"width":60,"height":39},{"text":"주소에서","x":841,"y":1683,"width":128,"height":40},{"text":"최상위","x":988,"y":1684,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"비트(most","x":1102,"y":1685,"width":150,"height":40},{"text":"significant","x":1267,"y":1688,"width":162,"height":38},{"text":"bit,","x":1444,"y":1690,"width":52,"height":34},{"text":"MSB)를","x":1512,"y":1689,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"의미하는","x":1666,"y":1687,"width":138,"height":40}]},{"text":"IP 주소의 네트워크 부분을 구성한다. 이를 해당 주소의 프리픽스(prefix) 또는 네트워","words":[{"text":"IP","x":551,"y":1748,"width":35,"height":29},{"text":"주소의","x":599,"y":1746,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":718,"y":1748,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"부분을","x":861,"y":1745,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"구성한다.","x":973,"y":1747,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"이를","x":1130,"y":1748,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"해당","x":1208,"y":1747,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"주소의","x":1287,"y":1748,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"프리픽스(prefix)","x":1403,"y":1748,"width":272,"height":42},{"text":"또는","x":1691,"y":1751,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"네트워","x":1776,"y":1751,"width":84,"height":36}]},{"text":"크 프리픽스라고 부른다. 한 기관은 통상 연속적 인(공통 프리픽스를 갖는 주소 범위) 주","words":[{"text":"크","x":550,"y":1811,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"프리픽스라고","x":594,"y":1809,"width":196,"height":38},{"text":"부른다.","x":800,"y":1808,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"한","x":920,"y":1808,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"기관은","x":967,"y":1809,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"통상","x":1077,"y":1810,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"연속적","x":1158,"y":1809,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"인(공통","x":1258,"y":1809,"width":112,"height":40},{"text":"프리픽스를","x":1382,"y":1809,"width":177,"height":39},{"text":"갖는","x":1573,"y":1811,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"주소","x":1658,"y":1813,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"범위)","x":1745,"y":1811,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"주","x":1834,"y":1815,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"소의 블록을 할당받는다. 이 경우에 기관 장비들의 IP 주소는 공통 프리픽스를 공유한","words":[{"text":"소의","x":551,"y":1869,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"블록을","x":633,"y":1870,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"할당받는다.","x":749,"y":1871,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":938,"y":1870,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"경우에","x":985,"y":1871,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"기관","x":1098,"y":1872,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"장비들의","x":1174,"y":1871,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"IP","x":1322,"y":1877,"width":33,"height":28},{"text":"주소는","x":1368,"y":1874,"width":106,"height":36},{"text":"공통","x":1487,"y":1873,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"프리픽스를","x":1573,"y":1872,"width":182,"height":38},{"text":"공유한","x":1769,"y":1874,"width":96,"height":37}]},{"text":"다. 5.4절에서 인터넷의 BGP 라우팅 프로로콜을 다룰 때, 단지 앞의 프리픽스 Ⅹ가 그","words":[{"text":"다.","x":552,"y":1929,"width":41,"height":39},{"text":"5.4절에서","x":609,"y":1932,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"인터넷의","x":776,"y":1932,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"BGP","x":919,"y":1936,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"라우팅","x":1009,"y":1933,"width":93,"height":39},{"text":"프로로콜을","x":1120,"y":1934,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"다룰","x":1300,"y":1934,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":1382,"y":1934,"width":41,"height":38},{"text":"단지","x":1440,"y":1934,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"앞의","x":1526,"y":1934,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"프리픽스","x":1612,"y":1934,"width":146,"height":38},{"text":"Ⅹ가","x":1770,"y":1935,"width":53,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1836,"y":1942,"width":30,"height":25}]},{"text":"기관 네트워크 외부의 라우터에 의해 고려된 것을 알게 된다. 즉, 외부 기관의 라우터","words":[{"text":"기관","x":553,"y":1991,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":636,"y":1993,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"외부의","x":786,"y":1994,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"라우터에","x":900,"y":1994,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"의해","x":1046,"y":1995,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"고려된","x":1125,"y":1996,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":1239,"y":1996,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"알게","x":1319,"y":1995,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":1401,"y":1995,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"즉,","x":1494,"y":1998,"width":45,"height":36},{"text":"외부","x":1558,"y":1996,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"기관의","x":1647,"y":1996,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"라우터","x":1771,"y":1997,"width":92,"height":38}]},{"text":"는 목적지 주소가 내부 기관인 데이터그램을 전달할 때, 단지 앞의 ⅹ비트들만 고려한","words":[{"text":"는","x":551,"y":2055,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"목적지","x":601,"y":2055,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"주소가","x":718,"y":2056,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"내부","x":835,"y":2056,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"기관인","x":916,"y":2055,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"데이터그램을","x":1030,"y":2057,"width":197,"height":39},{"text":"전달할","x":1243,"y":2058,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":1357,"y":2058,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"단지","x":1415,"y":2057,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"앞의","x":1501,"y":2057,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"ⅹ비트들만","x":1585,"y":2058,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"고려한","x":1771,"y":2059,"width":97,"height":38}]},{"text":"다는 것이다. 이것은 a.b.c.d/x 형태의 한 엔트리만으로 기관 목적지로 패것 전송이 충","words":[{"text":"다는","x":553,"y":2115,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":637,"y":2117,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"이것은","x":762,"y":2118,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"a.b.c.d/x","x":873,"y":2122,"width":129,"height":30},{"text":"형태의","x":1017,"y":2119,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"한","x":1128,"y":2120,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"엔트리만으로","x":1175,"y":2120,"width":198,"height":39},{"text":"기관","x":1388,"y":2119,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"목적지로","x":1469,"y":2119,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"패것","x":1632,"y":2119,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"전송이","x":1721,"y":2120,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"충","x":1838,"y":2121,"width":30,"height":38}]},{"text":"분하므로, 이런 라우터들에게 포워팅 테이블의 크기를 상당히 줄여 준다.","words":[{"text":"분하므로,","x":552,"y":2178,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"이런","x":714,"y":2179,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"라우터들에게","x":794,"y":2179,"width":193,"height":40},{"text":"포워팅","x":1002,"y":2181,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"테이블의","x":1113,"y":2181,"width":126,"height":39},{"text":"크기를","x":1254,"y":2182,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"상당히","x":1367,"y":2181,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"줄여","x":1482,"y":2182,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"준다.","x":1567,"y":2182,"width":82,"height":38}]},{"text":"주소의 나머지 32-Ⅹ 비트들은 기관 내부에 같은 네트워크 프리픽스를 갖는 모든","words":[{"text":"주소의","x":621,"y":2240,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"나머지","x":740,"y":2240,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"32-Ⅹ","x":855,"y":2245,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"비트들은","x":939,"y":2241,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"기관","x":1086,"y":2242,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"내부에","x":1168,"y":2243,"width":89,"height":38},{"text":"같은","x":1276,"y":2243,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":1360,"y":2242,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"프리픽스를","x":1514,"y":2244,"width":185,"height":38},{"text":"갖는","x":1717,"y":2243,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":1806,"y":2246,"width":63,"height":35}]},{"text":"장비들을 구별한다고 보면 된다. 이 비트들은 기관 내부의 라우터에서 패킷을 전달할","words":[{"text":"장비들을","x":553,"y":2300,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"구별한다고","x":706,"y":2301,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"보면","x":888,"y":2302,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"된다.","x":969,"y":2303,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":1059,"y":2304,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"비트들은","x":1107,"y":2304,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"기관","x":1251,"y":2305,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"내부의","x":1333,"y":2304,"width":92,"height":39},{"text":"라우터에서","x":1446,"y":2304,"width":176,"height":40},{"text":"패킷을","x":1645,"y":2304,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"전달할","x":1772,"y":2305,"width":98,"height":38}]},{"text":"때 사용되는 것이다. 이 하위 비트들은 앞서 언급한 것처럼 추가 서브넷 구조를 가질","words":[{"text":"때","x":554,"y":2361,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"사용되는","x":603,"y":2361,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":757,"y":2362,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":880,"y":2362,"width":27,"height":39},{"text":"하위","x":927,"y":2362,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"비트들은","x":1008,"y":2363,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"앞서","x":1152,"y":2364,"width":60,"height":39},{"text":"언급한","x":1233,"y":2365,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"것처럼","x":1347,"y":2365,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"추가","x":1463,"y":2366,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"서브넷","x":1553,"y":2366,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"구조를","x":1680,"y":2367,"width":111,"height":36},{"text":"가질","x":1807,"y":2366,"width":61,"height":37}]},{"text":"수도 있다. 예를 들어, CIDR식 주소 a.b.c.d/21의 첫 21비트들은 기관의 네트워크 프","words":[{